lic","site_admin":false},"open_issues":342,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:34Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-05-07T19:02:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T14:42:26Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T14:41:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Test in your browser: https://rafrafek.github.io/scaling_issue/\n\n### Tested versions\n\nSo far I only tested on the latest 4.7 beta:\nGodot v4.7.beta1 (without C#)\nGodot Engine v4.7.beta1.official.1c8cc9e7e - https://godotengine.org\nOpenGL API 3.3.0 Core Profile Context 26.5.1.260408 - Compatibility - Using Device: ATI Technologies Inc. - AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT latest drivers 26.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.31007.1017) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.91 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exported to web any Scaling3D scale below 1.0 causes huge performance drops. I tested on my machine with both Firefox and Chrome. I believe that lowering the resolution should not cause that drastic performance loss. Not only it runs 6x slower, but also uses 10x more CPU.\n\n<img width=\"3839\" height=\"1837\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e10d64c-8331-4202-b41a-65b05cdbccf8\" />\n\n<img width=\"3839\" height=\"1844\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eba58b6c-6300-4b99-9779-3158ac851c68\" />\n\n<img width=\"3839\" height=\"1860\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b12355df-5dec-4aa8-9aeb-ed72eba97f4b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Download/Clone MRP\n- Export MRP to web with export defaults\n- Run in any internet browser\n- Use slider to change the resolution to below 1.0\n- Look at the FPS counter dropping from 160 (my 4k monitor refresh rate) to 27 FPS when rendering a simple cube on a beefy graphics card.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/rafrafek/scaling_issue","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119317/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119317/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}